{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18420","headline":"中秋夜临镜湖望月 · 陈羽","name":"中秋夜临镜湖望月","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"镜里秋宵望，湖平月彩深。\n圆光珠入浦，浮照鹊惊林。\n澹动光还碎，婵娟影不沈。\n远时生岸曲，空处落波心。\n逈彻轮初满，孤明魄未侵。\n桂枝如可折，何惜夜登临。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈羽","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18420.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18420","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}